A||||2||Gokart||Horn wiring?
Z||000000||Gokart||08-28-99||08:28 PM||||My haynes and chilton doesn't contain any horn info. I bought a airhorn with diagram to hook up but I can't figure the factory horns? The one on the passenger side has one wire going to it and the one on the drivers side has two wires going to one clip! Does anyone know which ones are + and -? 
Z||000001||Cooter||08-28-99||09:50 PM||||The passenger side horn ties into the drivers side horn wire at the horn- two wires on the drivers side. One is from the relay and the other goes to the passenger horn. This is your "hot" wire to hook your horns to. You will need to ground your horns to the chasis to complete the circuit.
Z||000002||Gokart||08-29-99||04:35 AM||||TKS!
